            <InterfaceAsPlainText>
              <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">PROGRAM PRG_RegLatch&#xA;(* ZAshchelka sostoyaniya registrov: Nx_* -&gt; Rs_* i zerkalo HMI.&#xA;Rabotaet POSLE PLC_PRG, poetomu razryvaet kol co 'registry -&gt; ALU -&gt; registry' na granice POU. *)&#xA;VAR&#xA;	vReg_Checksum : BYTE; (* kontrol'naya summa registrov dlya HMI (set' LATCH 3) *)&#xA;END_VAR&#xA;</xhtml>
            </InterfaceAsPlainText>
          </data>
        </addData>
